      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16217/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large pot over medium-high heat. Sauté onion, garlic, and bay leaf in hot oil until onions are translucent, about 5 minutes. Add water, peas, barley, and salt; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 2 hours, stirring occasionally.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZClVqxjkcfI8ktTFx3As7ok7wHA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16217-vegan-split-pea-soup-ddmfs-step3-0509-8db0fa1807a34344826bdcd94250fc45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16217/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add potatoes, carrots, celery, parsley, basil, thyme, and pepper. Simmer until peas and vegetables are tender, about 1 hour.",
